(text "CH1 = HIGH_BUF - LOW_BUF (IN1P/IN1M); CH2 = LOW_BUF - TIA_OUT (IN2P/IN2M).\nEach leg: 1k series, 1k + 560pF to GND (K = 0.5), 1uF, BAT54S clamp, 470R to the pin.\nTDM controller: RP2040 drives BCLK 12MHz / FSYNC 187.5kHz. I2C address 0x50.\nAVDD from U15 AP2112K-3.3 on 5VA; IOVDD from 3V3." (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "32f3a303-03ee-5c18-81f6-57185f000732"))
